  "content": "[Intro]\n[D]  [A]\n[D]  [A]\n\n[Verse 1]\n[D]Have you seen the [A]little pig gies\n[D]Crawling in the dirt? [A]\n[D]And for all the [A]little pig gies\n[Bm]Life is getting worse [E]\n[Bm]Always having dirt [E]to\n[A]play around in\n[D]  [A]\n[D]  [A]\n\n[Verse 2]\n[D]Have you seen the [A]bigger pig gies\n[D]In their starched white [A]shirts?\n[D]You will find the [A]bigger pig gies\n[Bm]Stirring up the dirt [E]\n[Bm]Always have clean [E]shirts to\n[A]play around in\n[D]  [A]\n[D]  [F#]\n\n[Bridge]\n[Em]In their styes with [F#]all their backing\n[G]They don't [D]care what\n[A]goes on around\n[Em]In their eyes there's [F#]something lacking\n[G]What they need's a [A]damn good whacking\n\n[Interlude]\n[D]  [A]\n[D]  [A]\n[D]  [A]\n[Bm]  [E]\n[Bm]  [E]\n[A]\n[D]  [A]\n[D]  [A]\n\n[Verse 3]\n[D]Everywhere there's [A]lots of piggies\n[D]Living piggy lives [A]\n[D]You can see them [A]out for dinner\n[Bm]With their piggy wives [E]\n[Bm]Clutching forks and [E]knives to\n[A]eat their bacon\n\n[Outro]\n[D]  [A]\n[Dm]  [A]\n[Dm]  [A]\n[E]  [A]\n(One more time...)\n[Eb]\n[Bb]",
